  user_1,[00:00] Hello? Umm... hi, is this Anjali? I’m Sneha.
  user_2,[00:05] Hi Sneha, yes, Anjali speaking. How can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:12] I was just checking on my auto policy… I think it might be… expired?
  user_2,[00:18] Let me pull it up… [typing] yeah, I see here it expired on 15/08/2026. Sorry about that. [sighs]
  user_1,[00:30] Oh… okay. I wasn’t aware. Can we… renew it? Or what are my options?
  user_2,[00:38] We can definitely look at renewal. I’ll need a few details – your vehicle registration, any recent claims?
  user_1,[00:45] Yeah, the car is a 2019 Honda Civic, registration ABC-1234. No claims this year.
  user_2,[00:55] Great, I’ll start the renewal process and send you a quote by end of day. Anything else?